        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jefferson Davis, Franklin Pierce, Daniel S. Lamont\n- Roles: President of the White House of the Confederacy, United States Secretary of War\n- Organizations: White House of the Confederacy, Provisional Confederate States Constitution\n\nFacts:\n- Franklin Pierce had a United States Secretary of War serving under his administration.\n- Jefferson Davis held the United States office of Secretary of War under Franklin Pierce.\n- Jefferson Davis was the sole President of the White House of the Confederacy.\n- Jefferson Davis was elected President under the Provisional Confederate States Constitution.\n- Daniel S. Lamont also held the United States office of Secretary of War.",
